      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAPHNE DANGER (2) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 340m behind Enyo Danger (19.97) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Should be very hard to beat this time. SAMMY ROSS (4) scored (19.54) last time out at this track adding to an already respectable career. Form here sound including three wins. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. In sparkling form and looks the one to beat again. TIME WILL TELL (5) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Kept coming to finish eighth over 340m at this track (20.48) latest in a Grade 5. Has a strong record at this distance including two wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. One of the better chances. INSPECTOR FRANK (8) profiles nicely over this trip.",
